            search surface's default ordering: among hits of equal
            relevance the more recent comes first.  Leaf class wins over
            ancestors (effective-recency-slot-of).  Absent: no recency
            tie-break."}

  {:db/ident :dt/bm25f-weights
   :dt/type  :dt/Property
