            Weights control relative field contribution before scoring; they are
            not direct multipliers of the final document score.
            For example, name 12.0, description 8.0, and body-raw 1.0 emphasize
            descriptive fields. :db/tupleTypes declares the heterogeneous pair,
            unlike the homogeneous keyword pairs used by :dt/codec-aliases."}

